flowchart TD
    Start([Customer Initiates Checkout]) --> ValidateCart[Validate Non-Empty Cart & Address]
    ValidateCart --> LockStock[Begin DB Transaction & Lock Variant Inventory + Non-Expired Batches]
    LockStock --> CheckFEFO{Sufficient Non-Expired Stock?}
    CheckFEFO -- No --> Rollback([Rollback & Return 409 Conflict])
    CheckFEFO -- Yes --> CalcTotals[Validate Coupon & Compute Subtotal, Discount, Shipping, Total]
    CalcTotals --> SnapshotOrder[Create Order + Item/Address Snapshots + Payment Record]
    SnapshotOrder --> PayType{Payment Method?}
    PayType -- COD --> ReserveCOD[Reserve/Allocate Stock & Set Order CONFIRMED]
    PayType -- Online Sandbox --> PendingOnline[Reserve Stock & Set Order PAYMENT_PENDING]
    PendingOnline --> Webhook[Verify Signed Webhook & Idempotency Key]
    Webhook --> DeductFEFO[Deduct Remaining Quantity FEFO & Log Movement SOLD]
    ReserveCOD --> ClearCart[Clear Customer Cart & Commit]
    DeductFEFO --> ClearCart
    ClearCart --> Done([Order Confirmed & Notification Sent])

